# PLC Hardware Configuration - S7-1500

## CPU Configuration
**CPU Type**: S7-1516-3 PN/DP
**Order Number**: 6ES7 516-3AN00-0AB0
**Firmware Version**: V2.8
**Memory**: 1 MB work memory, 5 MB load memory

## Rack Configuration
### Rack 0 (Main Rack)
| Slot | Module | Order Number | Firmware | Status |
|------|--------|--------------|----------|--------|
| 0 | PS 307 5A | 6ES7 307-1EA00-0AA0 | - | Power Supply |
| 1 | CPU 1516-3 PN/DP | 6ES7 516-3AN00-0AB0 | V2.8 | CPU |
| 2 | SM 1231 AI 8x13bit | 6ES7 231-4HF32-0XB0 | V2.5 | Analog Input |
| 3 | SM 1232 AO 4x13bit | 6ES7 232-4HB32-0XB0 | V2.5 | Analog Output |
| 4 | SM 1231 DI 16x24VDC | 6ES7 231-4BH32-0XB0 | V2.5 | Digital Input |
| 5 | SM 1232 DQ 16x24VDC | 6ES7 232-4HB32-0XB0 | V2.5 | Digital Output |
| 6 | CM 1241 RS485 | 6ES7 241-1CH32-0XB0 | V2.5 | Communication |
| 7 | Empty | - | - | Reserved |

## Network Configuration
### PROFINET Interface X1
- **IP Address**: 192.168.0.10
- **Subnet Mask**: 255.255.255.0
- **Default Gateway**: 192.168.0.1
- **PROFINET Device Name**: PLC_S7_1500
- **Device ID**: 0x0000

### MPI/DP Interface X2
- **MPI Address**: 2
- **DP Master**: Yes
- **Baud Rate**: 12 Mbps
- **Highest DP Address**: 126

## System Addresses
### Digital Inputs
- **Start Address**: %I0.0
- **Total Points**: 32
- **Modules**: 2 x SM 1231 DI 16x24VDC

### Digital Outputs
- **Start Address**: %Q0.0
- **Total Points**: 32
- **Modules**: 2 x SM 1232 DQ 16x24VDC

### Analog Inputs
- **Start Address**: %IW256
- **Total Channels**: 8
- **Module**: SM 1231 AI 8x13bit
- **Resolution**: 13 bit
- **Signal Types**: 0-10V, 4-20mA

### Analog Outputs
- **Start Address**: %QW256
- **Total Channels**: 4
- **Module**: SM 1232 AO 4x13bit
- **Resolution**: 13 bit
- **Signal Types**: 0-10V, 4-20mA

## Memory Configuration
### Work Memory
- **Code Memory**: 750 KB
- **Data Memory**: 250 KB
- **Retentive Memory**: 128 KB

### Load Memory
- **Internal**: 1 MB
- **External (SIMATIC Card)**: 4 MB (optional)

## CPU Properties
### Cycle Time
- **Minimum**: 1 ms
- **Maximum**: 100 ms
- **Current**: 15 ms (typical)

### Watchdog
- **Cycle Monitoring**: Enabled
- **Cycle Time**: 5000 ms
- **Call Monitoring**: Enabled

### Time of Day
- **Synchronization**: Enabled
- **Interval**: 1 minute
- **Time Zone**: UTC+5:30 (adjust as needed)

### Interrupts
- **Hardware Interrupts**: 256
- **Diagnostic Interrupts**: 128
- **Time-of-Day Interrupts**: 2

## Safety Settings
- **Safety Integrated**: Disabled (standard CPU)
- **Access Level**: Full access (no protection)
- **Know-how Protection**: Disabled
- **Copy Protection**: Disabled

## Backup and Restore
- **Backup Frequency**: Weekly
- **Backup Location**: SIMATIC Memory Card
- **Auto Backup**: Enabled
- **Restore on Power Loss**: Disabled (manual)
